# needrestart-lxc: pre-generate the Zabbix JSON so the agent check stays fast.
# The full scan (including the CVE analysis) takes several seconds and would
# exceed the Zabbix server Timeout if run synchronously by the agent.
#
# The Zabbix master item polls every hour; this cron keeps the file fresh.
# The script writes /var/cache/needrestart-lxc/zabbix.json itself (creating the
# directory if needed), so no shell redirect is required here.
# flock prevents overlapping runs (a slow scan plus a manual script-server
# scan racing over the cache files).
*/15 * * * * root flock -n /run/lock/needrestart-lxc.lock /usr/local/bin/needrestart-lxc --zabbix